{
  "id": "u01",
  "section": 1,
  "order": 1,
  "title": { "en": "Greetings", "uz": "Salomlashish", "ru": "Приветствия", "tr": "Selamlaşma" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Say hello and goodbye, and ask how someone is.",
    "uz": "Salomlashish, xayrlashish va hol-ahvol so'rashni o'rganing.",
    "ru": "Научитесь здороваться, прощаться и спрашивать, как дела.",
    "tr": "Selam vermeyi, vedalaşmayı ve hal hatır sormayı öğren."
  },
  "guide": "everest",
  "color": "#2563EB",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "I am, you are", "uz": "I am, you are", "ru": "I am, you are", "tr": "I am, you are" },
    "body": {
      "en": "English always needs a verb. With \"I\" use \"am\": I am happy. With \"you\" use \"are\": You are happy. To ask a question, put \"are\" first: Are you happy?",
      "uz": "Ingliz tilida gapda doim fe'l bo'ladi. \"I\" bilan \"am\" ishlatiladi: I am happy. \"You\" bilan \"are\": You are happy. Savol berish uchun \"are\" oldinga chiqadi: Are you happy?",
      "ru": "В английском предложении всегда есть глагол. С \"I\" используется \"am\": I am happy. С \"you\" — \"are\": You are happy. В вопросе \"are\" ставится первым: Are you happy?",
      "tr": "İngilizcede cümlede her zaman bir fiil olur. \"I\" ile \"am\" kullanılır: I am happy. \"You\" ile \"are\": You are happy. Soru sormak için \"are\" başa gelir: Are you happy?"
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I am happy.", "native": { "uz": "Men xursandman.", "ru": "Я счастлив.", "tr": "Ben mutluyum." } },
      { "en": "Are you tired?", "native": { "uz": "Sen charchadingmi?", "ru": "Ты устал?", "tr": "Sen yorgun musun?" } }
    ]
  },
